  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: Liam says nothing for a long time. Then, very softly, he takes your hand,
      and it's warmer than you expected.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
