  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: It takes a long while for the two boys to speak to each other again. Eventually
      a ball rolls across a field and, without a word, one of them kicks it back.
